{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Aria": 7,
    "Canon": 9,
    "Sonnet": 14
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7617603",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761760301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761760301": {
            "id": "761760301",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "...Aria, Canon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760302"
            ]
          },
          "761760302": {
            "id": "761760302",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "This was far beyond mere punishment — and not for the first time, either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760303"
            ]
          },
          "761760303": {
            "id": "761760303",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Be it the city of dragons our King entrusted to us, or the fragile yet beautiful homes built by those tiny humans...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760304"
            ]
          },
          "761760304": {
            "id": "761760304",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "How many more innocent lives must you watch die before you stop standing idly by?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760305"
            ]
          },
          "761760305": {
            "id": "761760305",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "If our King were still here—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760306"
            ]
          },
          "761760306": {
            "id": "761760306",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "He is not here, Sonnet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760307"
            ]
          },
          "761760307": {
            "id": "761760307",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "If that far-from-omnipotent ruler believes this pale, horrifying fate to be \"order,\" if this is the only way to save this doomed world from being devoured, then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760308"
            ]
          },
          "761760308": {
            "id": "761760308",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "No matter how heavy the price demanded... and no matter how much sorrow that price brings me, it is far better than pitch-black silence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760309"
            ]
          },
          "761760309": {
            "id": "761760309",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "If the world is destined for destruction... What's the point of fighting the darkness?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760310"
            ]
          },
          "761760310": {
            "id": "761760310",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "...Sonnet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760311"
            ]
          },
          "761760311": {
            "id": "761760311",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Nothing, Sister Aria! Forget I said anything at all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760312"
            ]
          },
          "761760312": {
            "id": "761760312",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "I just think we shouldn't stand by and watch as that tyrant slaughters the living beings who put their faith in us... whether they be dragons or those tiny humans.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760313"
            ]
          },
          "761760313": {
            "id": "761760313",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Shouldn't we... save them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760314"
            ]
          },
          "761760314": {
            "id": "761760314",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760315"
            ]
          },
          "761760315": {
            "id": "761760315",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "...I can understand Sonnet's anger, Aria. To me, what that ruler did was far too cruel.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760316"
            ]
          },
          "761760316": {
            "id": "761760316",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "Even if there's only the slightest chance... I want to do everything in my power to save those who can be saved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760317"
            ]
          },
          "761760317": {
            "id": "761760317",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "But... what about those who can't be saved?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760318"
            ]
          },
          "761760318": {
            "id": "761760318",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Those for whom salvation does not come, whose lives were lost... Are their blood, tears, and wails of agony simply meant to vanish without a trace?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760319"
            ]
          },
          "761760319": {
            "id": "761760319",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "No... That isn't how it should be. I wish for everyone to be saved, and for none to fall.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760320"
            ]
          },
          "761760320": {
            "id": "761760320",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "If its \"order\" would perish alongside it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760321"
            ]
          },
          "761760321": {
            "id": "761760321",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "...Sonnet. Do not forget the reason for our birth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760322"
            ]
          },
          "761760322": {
            "id": "761760322",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Our mission is solely to preserve this world until our King, who granted us life, returns from afar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760323"
            ]
          },
          "761760323": {
            "id": "761760323",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "We knew what this order would cost from the beginning... but we could not allow this world to march toward destruction.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760324"
            ]
          },
          "761760324": {
            "id": "761760324",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "...No, this isn't even about order, Aria.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760325"
            ]
          },
          "761760325": {
            "id": "761760325",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "Sonnet, to us... to me, you are our dearest little sister.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760326"
            ]
          },
          "761760326": {
            "id": "761760326",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "So... please do not do anything that would hurt Aria and I.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760327"
            ]
          },
          "761760327": {
            "id": "761760327",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "Do not directly defy this heavenly order. At least... not now, while the world is still so fragile.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760328"
            ]
          },
          "761760328": {
            "id": "761760328",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Canon... I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760329"
            ]
          },
          "761760329": {
            "id": "761760329",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "Istaroth told me of a word that only humans may lay claim to... \"hope.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761760330"
            ]
          },
          "761760330": {
            "id": "761760330",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "As long as there is life, there is hope... There will always be hope."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}